%title=Spectral Determinant of a Cutoff-Regularized Hamiltonian and the Riemann Zeta Function\\[0.1em]\small  \textit  {PREPRINT — v3}\\[0.05em]\Small  DOI: \href  {https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.20357668}{10.5281/zenodo.20357668}
